00:41:04,120 --> 00:41:07,120
And if he gets your heart, the rules won't matter anymore.

486
00:41:08,220 --> 00:41:17,140
I believe today Jesus wants you to have a day three encounter similar to Saul's where you leave your religion behind in order to embrace a personal relationship with the living God.

487
00:41:17,140 --> 00:41:24,280
So, I don't know where we're all at in the room.

488
00:41:24,280 --> 00:41:27,240
I had to preach a message to like 12 different groups of people this morning.

