00:41:27,240 --> 00:41:30,480
So hopefully one of my 12 messages landed with you.

490
00:41:31,680 --> 00:41:40,900
But I've been pastoring long enough to know that many of us are wrestling with the pain, the despair, the disappointment of day one unmet expectations.

491
00:41:40,900 --> 00:41:46,780
Some of us have been stuck in day two confusion and coping for a long time.

492
00:41:46,780 --> 00:41:55,700
And I believe with all my heart that Easter would be just the perfect day for God to show up in your life.

493
00:41:55,700 --> 00:41:58,720
To give you a vision for day three hope.

494
00:41:58,860 --> 00:42:04,700
Not that eliminates all of your pain, but that gives you hope and peace in the midst of it.

495
00:42:04,700 --> 00:42:10,260
These three days, they're the most important days in human history.

496
00:42:10,260 --> 00:42:13,060
How will you respond to them?

497
00:42:13,060 --> 00:42:19,040
Will you submit your life to the one who gives resurrection life?

498
00:42:22,820 --> 00:42:29,560
So, for those of us that are here, that we've experienced day three hope and the resurrected Jesus, this morning is a morning of celebration.

