00:42:42,180 --> 00:42:49,280
Because we're pursuing this Jesus who raised from the dead, who can give us hope in the midst of our despair and our difficulty.

503
00:42:51,280 --> 00:42:59,960
So, if we're here, if we've experienced that today's the day of celebration, it's a reminder that the God we serve is able to turn our graves into gardens.

