00:43:01,620 --> 00:43:06,460
And if you're here and you're still waiting for that day three encounter, I legitimately have been praying for you all week.

505
00:43:06,460 --> 00:43:15,780
Believing that today might just be the day that you see and hear and respond to the goodness of God.

506
00:43:17,160 --> 00:43:20,800
Jesus says in Revelation, I stand at the door and knock.

