00:43:20,800 --> 00:43:27,880
If anyone hears my voice, if anyone hears my voice and opens the door, I will come to them.

508
00:43:27,880 --> 00:43:28,340
And what?

509
00:43:28,340 --> 00:43:29,320
I will eat with them.

510
00:43:29,320 --> 00:43:32,360
This is about fellowship with the living God.

511
00:43:32,360 --> 00:43:35,280
I will eat with them and they with me.

512
00:43:35,280 --> 00:43:39,640
Later, the author of Hebrews says this.

