00:43:43,380 --> 00:43:47,600
Today, if you have heard God's voice, do not harden your heart.

515
00:43:47,600 --> 00:43:52,740
Do not any longer give in to the lies of the enemy that this is just an idle tale.

516
00:43:52,740 --> 00:43:56,620
The God who created the universe came down in human flesh.

517
00:43:56,620 --> 00:43:58,460
He lived a perfect, sinless life.

518
00:43:58,460 --> 00:44:01,120
He died in your place for your sins.

519
00:44:01,120 --> 00:44:05,100
He offers resurrection, hope, and life.

520
00:44:05,200 --> 00:44:06,720
He's raised from the dead.

521
00:44:06,720 --> 00:44:08,360
It is not an idle tale.

522
00:44:08,360 --> 00:44:10,340
It is the truth of all truths.

